      ["A book has 300 pages. A girl reads 2/5 on day 1 and 25% of the remainder on day 2. How many pages are left?",["135","120","45","180"],"Day 1 120, left 180, day 2 45, left 135."],
      ["8 adult tickets and 4 child tickets cost $80. An adult ticket costs twice a child ticket. How much is a child ticket?",["$4","$8","$5","$10"],"Let child x, adult 2x. 16x + 4x = 20x = 80."]
